# BlitzBasic: Blitz3D/BlitzMax language reference; requirements/languages/blitzbasic.md
name     blitzbasic blitzmax bb bmx
keyword  Global Local Const Function EndFunction Type EndType Field If Then Else ElseIf EndIf For To
keyword  Step Next Each While Wend Repeat Until Forever Select Case Default EndSelect Return New Delete
keyword  And Or Not Mod Graphics Cls Flip End Strict Framework Import Method EndMethod Extends Self
